  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": " 七字仔時事報     "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5195417802315205\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">洪健斌</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1.倒閣無成政權穩，馬心爽暢弄喙唇，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">經濟拚好一月日，可見進前lóng leh睏。（2012.09.26）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2.Tsa̍h掉倒閣kho͘入府，馬請藍委來放肆，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">無聽建言專拚酒，人民血汗亂使舞。 &nbsp;（2012.09.26）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5195417802315205\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">3.關說不法惹風波，市長鴨霸行差錯，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tio̍h獎老師避同台，教示學子守正道。 （2012.09.26）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">4.馬統傾中門拍開，媒體染紅tio̍h bih喙，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">報導超過無站節，台辦電話隨來phuì。（2012.09.26）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">5.海巡保護眾漁船，逼倚釣島被圍困，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">台日互相拍水銃，煞戲一切照原本。（2012.09.27）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">6.時薪調kuân月俸無，質詢半途心肝慒，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">如玄含淚huah辭職，仙女下凡重頭熬。 （2012.09.27）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">7.同胞改做中國人，僑會英譯有空縫，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">痟馬連任催油門，唯中是從sak統房。 （2012.09.27）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">8.自比月娘siuⁿ過光，同仁ná星無準算，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Gâu寫hìng tak愛膨風，啟銘驕態lóng免粧。（2012.09.27）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">9.景氣連續十藍燈，錢途beh好ài真king，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">政府過年放九工，歹鬼tshuā頭tsiok僥倖。（2012.09.27） </span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">10.食用交際khai公庫，月給全數儉入戶，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">競選答應捐半薪，阿九蠻皮無beh吐。（2012.09.28）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">11.海基董座無薪水，江下林上改內規，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">月領三十好安搭，中森專心做馬喙。（2012.09.28）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">12.十萬老師徛出來，身穿烏衫展憤慨，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">教育承諾全跳票，阿九誠信通人唉。（2012.09.29）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">13.總統府內登山社，勘查為名做大爺，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">雪霸山屋佔兩工，官威thàng天無tsa̍h-jia。（2012.09.29）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">14.卸任bē赴見馬面，隔工上京真趕緊，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">台辦大頭拍kuân分，呵咾丙坤好鬥陣。（2012.09.29）</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">15.一表人材揀入府，永權馬前ná新婦，</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">轉huāⁿ黨部tio̍h好空，收花換桌做霸主。（2012.09.30）</span></b>"
  },
